<title>POLAND: PBR JAN NET FALLS TO PLN 1.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>PBR JAN NET FALLS TO PLN 1.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results January</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.91 vs    3.48</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    3.16 vs    5.78</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  6.65 vs    6.33</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	17.50 vs   17.27</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Polski Bank Rozwoju SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
